Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:47.12,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ふ、と　気が付く
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:51.60,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}風薫る　朝の気配
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.27,0:01:54.26,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}あ、と　思い出す
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:58.95,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}街並みと　彩度の中で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:03.67,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}あぁ、忙しなく　続いていく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:06.16,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}小さな世界は
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:10.49,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}柔らかくて　予測不能です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:14.67,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}あぁ　緩やかに　零れていく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:18.35,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}思い出を　そっと留めたら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:22.22,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}変わり続けていく　日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.93,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}胸を弾ませて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:26.33,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}触れて。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:28.22,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}触れてみれば
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:32.01,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}心は　鮮やかな透明で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:35.58,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}汚れた分だけ　色着いて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:38.68,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ほら、愛おしくなるでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:41.05,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}暮れて。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.01,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}暮れる太陽が
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:46.58,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}寄せては返す　日常が
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:50.44,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ほら、また世界を濯いでいく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:53.30,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}未来へ向かう朝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:56.93,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}綺麗、ですね　あぁ
Comment: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:56.93,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:47.12,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,驀然 意識回籠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:51.60,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,清風拂面 是清晨的氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.27,0:01:54.26,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,啊 我想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:58.95,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,在街道景象與色彩飽和度之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:03.67,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,啊 這小小的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:06.16,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,正忙碌地 持續地運轉著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.16,0:02:10.49,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,它是如此柔軟 且難以預料
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:14.67,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,啊 緩緩地 滿溢流瀉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:18.35,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,若能悄悄留住那些回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:22.22,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,便能在這不斷更迭的歲月裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.93,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,心跳隨之雀躍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:26.33,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,去觸碰吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:28.22,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,若是試著觸碰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:32.01,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,心靈本是鮮明而透明的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:35.58,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,正因沾染了歲月塵埃 才有了色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:38.68,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,你看，這不是變得更惹人憐愛了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:41.05,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,日落了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.01,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,落日餘暉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:46.58,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,與那潮起潮落般的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:50.44,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,看啊 再次洗滌了這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:53.30,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,那是邁向未來的清晨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:56.93,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,真的很美呢 啊啊
Comment: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:13.15,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}行こう　行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.42,0:22:20.27,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}新しい今日が君を待ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:24.33,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}行こう　行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.33,0:22:28.38,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}私らしくあるための
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:32.13,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}道なき道を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.13,0:22:36.48,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}取れかけたボタンひとつ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:42.76,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}そっと救ってくれた人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.06,0:22:47.35,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}隠せない君だけには
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.21,0:22:54.98,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}満ち溢れる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:23:00.65,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}繰り返し　紡いでいく　日々の中で
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.65,0:23:06.52,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}君は変わらずに微笑んでいて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.52,0:23:09.37,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}シャツの袖　捲ったら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.37,0:23:14.03,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}季節がまた巡るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.15,0:23:18.45,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}見守っていて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:26.06,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an8}忘れないよ
Comment: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:04.93,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:13.15,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,走吧　出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.42,0:22:20.27,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,嶄新的今天正等待著你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:24.33,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,走吧　出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.33,0:22:28.38,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,為了能活出自我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:32.13,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,在那無路可循的荒野上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.13,0:22:36.48,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,就像那一顆快脫落的鈕扣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:42.76,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,是你溫柔地將我拉起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.06,0:22:47.35,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,唯獨對你　我無法掩飾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.21,0:22:54.98,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,情感盈滿溢出
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:23:00.65,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,在不斷重複編織的日常裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.65,0:23:06.52,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,請你一如往常地保持微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.52,0:23:09.37,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,捲起襯衫的袖子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.37,0:23:14.03,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,季節便再次流轉更迭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.15,0:23:18.45,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,請就這樣守護著我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:26.06,OPEDJPCH,,0,0,0,,我不會忘記的
Comment: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,小祥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天回家路上 能不能順便去看看外公
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,毬祥 書包 書包
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H323839&\3c&H97CCA7&\shad0\pos(960,324)\fad(1,273)}感謝您的惠顧\N{\b1\an16}金目洗衣店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 變得好乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,來 小祥 要道謝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,非常謝謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哪裡哪裡 我才要感謝您選擇金目洗衣店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs39\shad6\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord3\shad0\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(393,48)}第{\c&H8065C7&}11{\c&H222C04&}話   {\c&H222C04&}為了{\c&H8F8B3E&\3c&HEDD7D3&}這個孩子{\c&H222C04&}——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,主角戴著眼鏡又很文靜 我還以為
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,這根本是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真敢說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 小祥 我很吵嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,今天要上的是動詞的活用形
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,例如現代日文的「思わない」古文是「思わず」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,「思いました」變成「思いけり」\N「思う」變成「思ふ」，「思うとき」…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,喔喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 小祥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然還是該加入田徑社啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都已經…二年級了…現在才加入也太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不會啦 沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 考慮一下啦 我們現在正好缺中距離跑者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是沒錯…但我家裡也需要幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你會這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那我只好自己跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,小祥 你最近是不是常常在發呆啊 沒睡好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小祥一直都呆呆的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不過覺還是要睡飽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是躺平五秒就睡著了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,聽好了 雖然解數學題的時候 大家都會想用最簡單的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果能想到 原來還有這種解法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就會覺得有趣起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那就用這個公式來求出這裡的值
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,佐藤同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…今天晚上可以跟我睡同一個房間嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 我吵醒你了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,剛剛在洗澡的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在想 我到底是從什麼時候開始討厭打雷的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好 今天就上到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,大家回去要好好複習喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 數學課我完全沒聽進去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,石持 {\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pr5 B\fs80}鰙{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你們兩個晚上有好好睡覺嗎 最近上課一直打瞌睡喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 要打起精神來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 好乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,書包這麼乾淨 整個人看起來就不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝老師
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,反觀…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pr5 B\fs80}鰙{\r}你的書包很髒欸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有啦 我這禮拜就打算洗了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 小祥 你不下車嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:06:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去外公家一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,掰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,二號月台車門即將關閉 請注意安全
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,難得都來了 乾脆到上面去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不過爬這階梯還是一樣累人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但感覺比小時候輕鬆一點了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 欸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,金目小姐 你怎麼會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我才想問你呢 毬祥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我來打掃 順便上來神社看看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,打掃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…下面有我外公的墳墓
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 原來是來掃墓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,平常都是我媽來 今天剛好叫我來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你好孝順喔 有好好祭拜祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有啦 說得有點太誇張了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.01,0:09:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不過就是因為有外公他們 才有現在的我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.19,0:09:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,毬祥 你這種地方我很喜歡喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 金目小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直有件事在想…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 怎麼了 毬祥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 現在店裡有點忙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可能要比平常多花一天的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,請問這樣可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,非常謝謝您 就交給金目我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那就麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,金目姊姊 您好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 你們好 歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 看起來生意很好呢
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.47,0:11:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}是啊 託大家的福
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HC89668&\frz359.9\fscx33\fscy9\pos(868.5,72)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.64,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\b1\fs84\shad0\an8\c&HFBF2E2&\3c&HC89668&\pos(867,60)}小知識
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HB6D0E3&\frz359.9\pos(1228.5,144)\fscx58\fscy29}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\b1\fs72\shad0\an8\c&H566C7F&\3c&HB6D0E3&\pos(1215,150)}洗衣店的\N{\fs108}旺季
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HECE9F7&\frz359.9\fscx53\fscy27\pos(1207.5,396)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\b1\fs72\shad0\an8\c&H9585D8&\3c&HECE9F7&\pos(1212,405)}4～6月\N (冬衣換季)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HF4E8D0&\frz359.9\fscx46\fscy28\pos(1216.5,630)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\b1\fs72\shad0\an8\c&HB1806C&\3c&HF4E8D0&\pos(1212,645)}9～10月\N(夏衣換季)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HC3F3FF&\frz359.9\fscx53\fscy27\pos(1210.5,870)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.68,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(687,1)\b1\fs72\shad0\an8\c&H639FE1&\3c&HC3F3FF&\pos(1212,879)}歲末年初\N(大掃除)
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.47,0:11:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}這個時期的送洗量會比較多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H6166CE&\frz359.9\fscx18\fscy11\pos(943.5,690)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.98,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\an6\shad0\c&HEFF1F9&\3c&H6166CE&\pos(1020,723)}現在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H6166CE&\frz359.9\fscx18\fscy11\pos(943.5,690)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\an6\shad0\c&HEFF1F9&\3c&H6166CE&\pos(1020,723)}現在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那真不好意思還來打擾你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這些可以麻煩你幫忙清洗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,當然可以 非常謝謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,又要拍社群網站要用的照片嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽 我想再拍一下姊姊 拍完再回去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎 你明明這麼忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我絕對不會打擾姊姊工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊 那真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那色 不可以給人家添麻煩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這種照片之前不是已經拍過很多了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒有那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要定期拍姊姊工作的照片 發到動態時報上才行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣運作的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 而且比起照片 影片的迴響會更好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 像這個
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.18,0:13:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,觀看次數…一萬次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(285,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\frz359.9\frz22.87\fscx163\fscy49\pos(1093.5,750)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fs72\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H717578&\fad(285,1)\frz22.87\pos(570,855)\b1}觀看 10,126 次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(285,1)\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\frz359.9\frz22.87\fscx71\fscy15\pos(772.5,771)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fs66\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H717578&\fad(285,1)\frz22.87\pos(639,945)}這是金目洗衣店的店長金目小姐，正在處理顧客\N衣物上的污漬！\N她非常細心地按順序使用用多種洗劑，小心翼翼\N地將污漬去除！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.84,0:13:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 不只我
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.10,0:13:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好像都對去漬噴槍很有興趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以今天也想拍去漬的影片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯… 可是今天的去漬工作差不多都做完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 那邊是什麼 地板上有個四方形的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 四方形
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 你是說那個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼門嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 大概是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒有打開過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我剛搬來這裡的時候 試著開過一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可是把手卡得很緊 我就放棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那個那個 我們現在就來打開它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定會有驚人的大發現 快準備火把
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 火把
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,上次是抓住把手想拉開 結果打不開
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 這樣一來…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,打開了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 原來是整個掀開的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是地下儲藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我的城堡…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,應該是以前在這裡營業的洗衣店留下的東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,幾乎都劣化跟生鏽了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你發現什麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,布偶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,袋子破了個洞 所以弄得髒兮兮的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,上面有收據
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說 這是客人送來要清洗的物品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,發霉跟泛黃的狀況很嚴重呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來好可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,地板下面濕氣重 又不通風
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,本來就不適合用來保管布料製品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:16:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼客人重要的布偶會被放在這種地方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,安治太太說過 這間店在我搬進來很久以前也是洗衣店
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HB789E7&\frz359.9\pos(277.5,21)\fscx75\fscy48}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs90\c&HA3EFFE&\3c&HBA86E9&\shad0\pos(280.8,126)}歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HEAEDED&\frz359.9\pos(280.5,132)\fscx67\fscy28}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs75\c&HEEC860&\3c&HEAEDED&\shad0\pos(61.8,141)}每週二\N點數2倍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,如果這是當時的店長做的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,身為同行 我實在無法認同
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 你的表情好嚇人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,總之得先聯絡失主才行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 收據上的電話打不通呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不過上面倒是有地址…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 這隻布偶 你打算怎麼處理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,說得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,961)\shad0\c&H848A92&\3c&HB3D3E2&\an7}收據\N {\fs42}地址：\N {\fs42}姓名：{\fs54}陸\N\N{\fs42}收件日：6月4日 \N預定取件日：6月25日\N\N取件時請攜帶本收據。\N 未於一個月內取件之物品，本店恕不負保管責任。\N\N 品項：布偶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,這畢竟是之前的店家接的單
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我擅自處理可能有點多管閒事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 我實在沒辦法對這麼髒的東西視而不見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把它洗乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也是為了這個一直被關在又暗又窄的地方的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊 你現在在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這是在做按壓清洗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,因為布偶裡面有填充物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以在溫水裡加入少量的市售弱酸性洗劑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,像這樣輕輕按壓來清洗內部
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 好像在幫這個布偶洗澡一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,按壓清洗之後 再用同樣的方式 重複沖洗兩到三次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,這種布偶裡面的填充物材質不明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,所以除非萬不得已 最好不要連內部都清洗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.87,0:18:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而且如果沒有把它 徹底晾乾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,反而很容易成為黴菌的溫床
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然後呢 然後呢 接下來要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要脫水
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,要讓它在裡面轉圈圈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果脫水力道太強 裡面的填充物會結成一團
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,導致布偶變形
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以要留意時間跟溫度先脫到半乾的狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 可是你不是說要徹底晾乾嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 所以接下來要帶它到後院去休息
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這是平鋪晾衣網
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就這樣掛在陰涼處 直到晾乾為止 就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,這個肯定會是很受歡迎的貼文
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那色 這件事可以先別發到網路上嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
